00:11:15.764 --> 00:11:16.665
You know why I do what I do

00:11:16.665 --> 00:11:17.938
and I do it so passionately?

00:11:17.938 --> 00:11:19.808
'Cause my grandfather was
a high school dropout,

00:11:19.808 --> 00:11:21.411
my father was a high school dropout,

00:11:21.411 --> 00:11:24.211
I was a high school dropout and
we about to break the cycle.

00:11:24.211 --> 00:11:26.776
I do what I do so my son
won't have to go through

00:11:26.776 --> 00:11:28.615
what I went through.

00:11:28.615 --> 00:11:29.715
When I was at the football game,

00:11:29.715 --> 00:11:31.015
my little dude went with me.

00:11:31.015 --> 00:11:32.163
I saw other kids with they ...

00:11:32.163 --> 00:11:33.922
I said that'll never happen to me.

00:11:33.922 --> 00:11:35.934
I do what I do because my daughter says

00:11:35.934 --> 00:11:37.064
she goin' to Harvard.

00:11:37.064 --> 00:11:38.148
It ain't even about you all.

00:11:38.148 --> 00:11:39.978
I'm about to come here and blaze you all.

00:11:39.978 --> 00:11:40.811
Why?

00:11:40.811 --> 00:11:42.556
'Cause I'm tryin' to get you all in NFL.

00:11:42.556 --> 00:11:44.329
I ain't about to miss this opportunity.

00:11:44.329 --> 00:11:46.908
This is the first NFL team I've ever done

00:11:46.908 --> 00:11:49.588
in my life and I'm about to lick it.

00:11:49.588 --> 00:11:51.638
I'm about to give everything
I've got and I will know

00:11:51.638 --> 00:11:53.399
if I don't get another gig,

00:11:53.399 --> 00:11:54.857
it won't have to do with the fact

00:11:54.857 --> 00:11:58.416
that I didn't put everything on the field.

00:11:58.416 --> 00:11:59.511
What's your why?

00:11:59.511 --> 00:12:00.930
Why do you wake up in the morning?

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:02.299
Why do you put on that jersey?

00:12:02.299 --> 00:12:03.547
Why do you go out and practice?

00:12:03.547 --> 00:12:04.610
Why?

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:08.360
I have a ritual where
even my closest friend,

00:12:11.532 --> 00:12:13.450
I have boundaries.

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:15.449
So just because it's my
company, it doesn't mean

00:12:15.449 --> 00:12:17.233
I can take calls all day.

00:12:17.233 --> 00:12:20.030
I have boundaries so you can't
call me at a certain time.

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:20.863
Why?

00:12:20.863 --> 00:12:21.717
I'm working.

00:12:21.717 --> 00:12:23.988
So I'm on the phone all
day and I'm saying this

00:12:23.988 --> 00:12:26.592
to entrepreneurs because one of the gaps,

00:12:26.592 --> 00:12:28.255
and we'll talk about
this later in the show,

00:12:28.255 --> 00:12:30.113
but you got to find a
gap and one of the gaps

00:12:30.113 --> 00:12:32.524
for entrepreneurs is that they feel like

00:12:32.524 --> 00:12:34.219
because they own their day,

00:12:34.219 --> 00:12:35.685
they can spend it like they want.

00:12:35.685 --> 00:12:38.230
You cannot spend it like you want to.

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:41.530
So if you were working for IBM
or you were working for Ford,

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:42.986
whoever you were workin' for, you couldn't

00:12:42.986 --> 00:12:45.578
be on the phone all day
at a major corporation

00:12:45.578 --> 00:12:46.777
talkin' on the phone.

00:12:46.777 --> 00:12:49.125
So why do you allow yourself
to talk on the phone

00:12:49.125 --> 00:12:50.313
when you're a business?

00:12:50.313 --> 00:12:51.957
Now if that is yours, you should probably,

00:12:51.957 --> 00:12:54.716
you should make sure there's
no phone calls goin' on.

00:12:54.716 --> 00:12:55.767
That is your business.

00:12:55.767 --> 00:12:58.544
One of my rituals is when I get started,

00:12:58.544 --> 00:12:59.844
there are no interruptions.

00:12:59.844 --> 00:13:02.510
When I get started, I
don't care if it's my wife,

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:06.147
my children, they know that
for a certain time frame,

00:13:06.147 --> 00:13:10.529
I'm going all in and I can't
go all in and answer the phone.

00:13:10.529 --> 00:13:12.557
I can't go all in watchin' TV.

00:13:12.557 --> 00:13:13.688
- And the distraction.

00:13:13.688 --> 00:13:14.878
- I can't go in with the distraction.

00:13:14.878 --> 00:13:18.013
Some entrepreneurs are like,
why am I not blowin' up?

00:13:18.013 --> 00:13:20.388
Because you're not an abstraction.

00:13:20.388 --> 00:13:23.393
You don't have that moment of your day.

00:13:23.393 --> 00:13:25.979
I don't care if it's
two hours, four hours,

00:13:25.979 --> 00:13:28.403
where you shut the entire world out.

00:13:28.403 --> 00:13:29.546
No twitter.

00:13:29.546 --> 00:13:30.779
No Facebook.

00:13:30.779 --> 00:13:32.527
No nothing.

00:13:32.527 --> 00:13:33.809
- No Instagram, what we love the most.

00:13:33.809 --> 00:13:35.915
- No Instagram, no Instagram.

00:13:35.915 --> 00:13:36.830
- We love that Instagram.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:40.071
- Oh, for just the two hours, I'm goin' in

00:13:40.071 --> 00:13:42.589
and once I come out,
