00:13:42.589 --> 00:13:43.626
But I'll be honest,

00:13:43.626 --> 00:13:46.650
your content probably will be stronger

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:50.458
if you had that time of
isolation, of solitude,

00:13:50.458 --> 00:13:52.307
where you give yourself a chance to think,

00:13:52.307 --> 00:13:54.759
you give yourself a chance to go in.

00:13:54.759 --> 00:13:58.463
And when you go in, you go 120%.

00:13:58.463 --> 00:13:59.388
So yeah, that's my ritual.

00:13:59.388 --> 00:14:00.221
- I like that.

00:14:00.221 --> 00:14:03.577
- I think what's so unique
about my presentation

00:14:03.577 --> 00:14:05.568
is that it comes from the heart.

00:14:05.568 --> 00:14:06.719
You know, I speak from the heart

00:14:06.719 --> 00:14:08.059
and I'm not afraid to be transparent.

00:14:08.059 --> 00:14:10.369
I'm not afraid to talk about my failures.

00:14:10.369 --> 00:14:12.903
I'm not afraid to talk about my fears.

00:14:12.903 --> 00:14:17.070
I'm not afraid to open up
my life and give my story

00:14:18.145 --> 00:14:19.228
to the world.

00:14:21.035 --> 00:14:22.683
So if you want to make six
figures, you can't just

00:14:22.683 --> 00:14:25.263
be talking about you
want to make six figures.

00:14:25.263 --> 00:14:26.868
You hear what I'm saying here tonight.

00:14:26.868 --> 00:14:29.379
If you do the three things
I tell you to do tonight,

00:14:29.379 --> 00:14:31.430
I guarantee you whatever it
is you want to do in life,

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:32.907
you'll be able to do it.

00:14:32.907 --> 00:14:35.075
You will be able to accomplish
whatever you want to

00:14:35.075 --> 00:14:38.405
academically, financially,
relationally, whatever.

00:14:38.405 --> 00:14:39.499
So three things.

00:14:39.499 --> 00:14:40.660
All right, I'm going
to tell you this story,

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:41.670
I've got to get out of here.

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:43.262
And the story is about,
you guys have probably

00:14:43.262 --> 00:14:44.383
heard about this before.

00:14:44.383 --> 00:14:47.132
It was a young man, you
know, he wanted to make

00:14:47.132 --> 00:14:50.577
a lot of money and so he
went to this guru, right?

00:14:50.577 --> 00:14:51.814
And he told the guru, "I want to be

00:14:51.814 --> 00:14:53.140
"on the same level you are."

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:54.306
So the guru said, "If you want to be

00:14:54.306 --> 00:14:55.685
"on the same level I'm on,

00:14:55.685 --> 00:14:59.852
"I'll meet you tomorrow
at the beach at 4:00 a.m."

00:15:00.787 --> 00:15:02.579
He's like, "The beach?

00:15:02.579 --> 00:15:05.561
"I said I want to make
money, I don't want to swim."

00:15:05.561 --> 00:15:06.975
Guru said, "If you want to make money,

00:15:06.975 --> 00:15:08.919
"I'll meet you tomorrow,

00:15:08.919 --> 00:15:10.052
"4:00 a.m."

00:15:10.052 --> 00:15:11.976
So the young man got there at 4:00 a.m.,

00:15:11.976 --> 00:15:14.778
he all ready to rock
and roll, got on a suit,

00:15:14.778 --> 00:15:16.643
