00:15:16.643 --> 00:15:18.291
The old man grabs his
hand and said, "How bad

00:15:18.291 --> 00:15:19.664
"do you want to be successful?"

00:15:19.664 --> 00:15:20.651
He said, "Real bad."

00:15:20.651 --> 00:15:22.471
He said, "Walk on out in the water."

00:15:22.471 --> 00:15:23.710
So he walks out into
the water, watch this.

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:24.543
When he walks out into the
water, it goes waist deep.

00:15:24.543 --> 00:15:27.210
So he's like, "This guy's crazy.

00:15:29.214 --> 00:15:31.915
"I want to make money, he
got me out here swimmin'.

00:15:31.915 --> 00:15:33.910
"I didn't ask to be a lifeguard.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.118
"I want to make money."

00:15:35.118 --> 00:15:37.452
So he said, "Come on
out a little further."

00:15:37.452 --> 00:15:39.542
Walked out a little
further, then he had it

00:15:39.542 --> 00:15:42.832
around this area, his shoulder area.

00:15:42.832 --> 00:15:46.443
Said, "This old man crazy. He
makin' money but he crazy."

00:15:46.443 --> 00:15:47.644
Said, "Come on out a little further."

00:15:47.644 --> 00:15:49.773
Came out a little further,
it was right at his mouth.

00:15:49.773 --> 00:15:51.936
"My man, like I'm about to
go back in. This guy out

00:15:51.936 --> 00:15:53.248
of his mind."

00:15:53.248 --> 00:15:54.341
So the old man said, "I
thought you said you wanted

00:15:54.341 --> 00:15:55.630
