00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:56.615
He said, "I do."

00:15:56.615 --> 00:15:57.759
He said, "Walk a little further."

00:15:57.759 --> 00:16:00.315
He came, dropped his
head in, held him down,

00:16:00.315 --> 00:16:03.168
