scratch him, hold him down,

00:16:03.168 --> 00:16:05.577
I got you, I know you
busted out but I got you.

00:16:05.577 --> 00:16:06.948
He had him held down.

00:16:06.948 --> 00:16:08.597
I need you for a illustration.

00:16:08.597 --> 00:16:11.027
He had him held down, just before my man

00:16:11.027 --> 00:16:14.168
was about to pass out, he raised him up.

00:16:14.168 --> 00:16:15.551
He said, "I got a question for you."

00:16:15.551 --> 00:16:17.359
Somebody answer the question for me.

00:16:17.359 --> 00:16:18.975
He said, "When you were underwater,

00:16:18.975 --> 00:16:21.026
what did you want to do?"

00:16:21.026 --> 00:16:23.180
- [Female] Live, I guess.

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:25.176
- Live, I'm lookin' for a
different word though than live.

00:16:25.176 --> 00:16:26.009
What's that word?

00:16:26.009 --> 00:16:27.052
