00:16:27.052 --> 00:16:29.801
- Said, "I wanted to breathe."

00:16:29.801 --> 00:16:33.955
He told the guy, he said,
"When you want to succeed

00:16:33.955 --> 00:16:38.122
as bad as you want to breathe,
then you'll be successful."

00:16:39.944 --> 00:16:41.753
I don't know how many of you
all got asthma in here today,

00:16:41.753 --> 00:16:43.862
but if you've ever had
an asthma attack before,

00:16:43.862 --> 00:16:47.192
you short of breath,
SOB, shortness of breath,

00:16:47.192 --> 00:16:50.712
