00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:55.034
You don't care about no basketball game.

00:16:55.034 --> 00:16:56.441
You don't care what's on TV,

00:16:56.441 --> 00:16:57.978
you don't care about nobody callin' you,

00:16:57.978 --> 00:16:59.505
you don't care about a party.

00:16:59.505 --> 00:17:02.469
The only thing you care about
when you're tryin' to breathe

00:17:02.469 --> 00:17:03.602
is to get some fresh air.

00:17:03.602 --> 00:17:05.040
That's it.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:07.957
And when you get to the point
where all you want to do

00:17:07.957 --> 00:17:10.635
is be successful as bad
as you want to breathe,

00:17:10.635 --> 00:17:12.481
then you'll be successful.

00:17:12.481 --> 00:17:14.061
And I'm here to tell you, number one,

00:17:14.061 --> 00:17:16.351
