00:17:17.687 --> 00:17:19.562
You just kind of want it.

00:17:19.562 --> 00:17:21.526
You don't want it badder
than you want to party.

00:17:21.526 --> 00:17:23.639
You don't want it as much
as you want to be cool.

00:17:23.639 --> 00:17:28.237
Most of you don't want success
as much as you want to sleep.

00:17:28.237 --> 00:17:30.750
Some of you love sleep
more than you love success.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.222
And I'm here to tell you today,

00:17:32.222 --> 00:17:34.442
if you're going to be successful,

00:17:34.442 --> 00:17:37.859
you've got to be willin' to give up sleep.

00:17:39.178 --> 00:17:41.242
You've got to be willin' to
work off three hours of sleep,

00:17:41.242 --> 00:17:42.280
two hours.

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:44.322
If you really want to
be successful, some days

00:17:44.322 --> 00:17:47.003
