00:17:51.233 --> 00:17:52.943
That's how bad you've got to want it.

00:17:52.943 --> 00:17:54.088
You've got to go days without ...

00:17:54.088 --> 00:17:56.144
Listen to me, you've got to
want to be successful so bad

00:17:56.144 --> 00:17:58.061
